4:if(AIS_GetAIState()=SATTACK&AIS_GetHP()<110&AIS_IsCanSkill(1826)=1){AIS_ToSkill(1826);AIS_SetTimes(1);AIS_SetPRI(34);};在血少于80%时释放584号技能，次数1
